  "conclusion": "LightGBM catches 149 of 224 High-risk records against unscaled SDCA's 5 and cuts the estimated business cost by 66.7% ($228,550 to $76,100). Normalization alone lifts SDCA with the six original features to TP 160, FP 19, High F1 0.794 and cost $64,950, which beats LightGBM on the same features. The four oracle-informed features add nothing without scaling and a smaller gain with it (TP 167, F1 0.815, cost $57,950). Feature scaling explains most of the improvement. These are cross-validation estimates; test-1000.csv is untouched.",
